(933,1694,$mw$F03C900CE5A86657609F7A6C472062AB981F3D976092BF5915608DADCFCD3DC8$mw$,$mw$dbcb6e8a6e1bcd087abe6c264d11ce5d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1694,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":87,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"للمتجهين a=(1,-2) وb=(-2,1)، ما قيمة ضربهما القياسي التي تدل على أن الزاوية بينهما منفرجة؟","TitleEn":"For a=(1,-2) and b=(-2,1), what is their dot product, indicating that the angle between them is obtu","QuestionTextAr":"للمتجهين a=(1,-2) وb=(-2,1)، ما قيمة ضربهما القياسي التي تدل على أن الزاوية بينهما منفرجة؟","QuestionTextEn":"For a=(1,-2) and b=(-2,1), what is their dot product, indicating that the angle between them is obtuse?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: معيار الزاوية المنفرجة: a·b<0 لمتجهين غير صفريين.\n\nخطوات الحل: نحسب 1×(-2)+(-2)×1=-4؛ الإشارة السالبة تؤكد أن الزاوية بين المتجهين منفرجة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Obtuse-angle criterion: a·b<0 for two nonzero vectors.\n\nSolution steps: The dot product is 1×(−2)+(−2)×1=−4; a negative dot product means the angle is obtuse.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6765,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6766,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6767,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6768,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اضرب المركبات المتناظرة.","En":"Multiply corresponding components."},{"Ar":"اجمع الجداءين وافحص إشارة الناتج.","En":"Add the products and inspect the sign."}],"Title":{"Ar":"للمتجهين a=(1,-2) وb=(-2,1)، ما قيمة ضربهما القياسي التي تدل على أن الزاوية بينهما منفرجة؟","En":"For a=(1,-2) and b=(-2,1), what is their dot product, indicating that the angle between them is obtu"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"−2 يمثل جداءً واحداً فقط.","En":"−2 accounts for only one product."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-2"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الجداءان سالبان ولا يلغي أحدهما الآخر.","En":"Both products are negative and cannot cancel."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 يفقد الإشارتين السالبتين.","En":"4 loses the negative signs."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"للمتجهين a=(1,-2) وb=(-2,1)، ما قيمة ضربهما القياسي التي تدل على أن الزاوية بينهما منفرجة؟","En":"For a=(1,-2) and b=(-2,1), what is their dot product, indicating that the angle between them is obtuse?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب القياسي السالب لمتجهين غير صفريين يعني زاوية منفرجة.","En":"A negative dot product of nonzero vectors indicates an obtuse angle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب المركبتين الأفقيتين: الناتج −2.","En":"Multiply the horizontal components: the product is −2."},{"Ar":"نضرب المركبتين العموديتين: الناتج −2 أيضاً.","En":"Multiply the vertical components: the product is also −2."},{"Ar":"نجمع الناتجين؛ وبما أن المتجهين غير صفريين والضرب سالب فالزاوية منفرجة.","En":"Add the products; both vectors are nonzero and the negative dot product implies an obtuse angle."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-4$","En":"$-4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف الإشارات السالبة.","En":"Do not drop negative signs."},"FormulaLatex":"\\mathbf a\\cdot\\mathbf b=a_xb_x+a_yb_y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1(-2)+(-2)(1)=-2-2=-4$","En":"$1(-2)+(-2)(1)=-2-2=-4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\|a\\|=\\|b\\|=\\sqrt5,\\quad\\cos\\theta=-4/5<0$","En":"$\\|a\\|=\\|b\\|=\\sqrt5,\\quad\\cos\\theta=-4/5<0$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":338,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اضرب المركبات المتناظرة.","En":"Multiply corresponding components."},{"Ar":"اجمع الجداءين وافحص إشارة الناتج.","En":"Add the products and inspect the sign."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب القياسي السالب لمتجهين غير صفريين يعني زاوية منفرجة.","En":"A negative dot product of nonzero vectors indicates an obtuse angle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب المركبتين الأفقيتين: الناتج −2.","En":"Multiply the horizontal components: the product is −2."},{"Ar":"نضرب المركبتين العموديتين: الناتج −2 أيضاً.","En":"Multiply the vertical components: the product is also −2."},{"Ar":"نجمع الناتجين؛ وبما أن المتجهين غير صفريين والضرب سالب فالزاوية منفرجة.","En":"Add the products; both vectors are nonzero and the negative dot product implies an obtuse angle."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-4$","En":"$-4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف الإشارات السالبة.","En":"Do not drop negative signs."},"FormulaLatex":"\\mathbf a\\cdot\\mathbf b=a_xb_x+a_yb_y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1(-2)+(-2)(1)=-2-2=-4$","En":"$1(-2)+(-2)(1)=-2-2=-4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\|a\\|=\\|b\\|=\\sqrt5,\\quad\\cos\\theta=-4/5<0$","En":"$\\|a\\|=\\|b\\|=\\sqrt5,\\quad\\cos\\theta=-4/5<0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−2 يمثل جداءً واحداً فقط.","En":"−2 accounts for only one product."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الجداءان سالبان ولا يلغي أحدهما الآخر.","En":"Both products are negative and cannot cancel."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 يفقد الإشارتين السالبتين.","En":"4 loses the negative signs."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الضرب القياسي السالب لمتجهين غير صفريين يعني زاوية منفرجة.

$\mathbf a\cdot\mathbf b=a_xb_x+a_yb_y$

1. نضرب المركبتين الأفقيتين: الناتج −2.

2. نضرب المركبتين العموديتين: الناتج −2 أيضاً.

3. نجمع الناتجين؛ وبما أن المتجهين غير صفريين والضرب سالب فالزاوية منفرجة.

$1(-2)+(-2)(1)=-2-2=-4$

$-4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\|a\|=\|b\|=\sqrt5,\quad\cos\theta=-4/5<0$

لا تحذف الإشارات السالبة.$mw$,$mw$A negative dot product of nonzero vectors indicates an obtuse angle.

$\mathbf a\cdot\mathbf b=a_xb_x+a_yb_y$

1. Multiply the horizontal components: the product is −2.

2. Multiply the vertical components: the product is also −2.

3. Add the products; both vectors are nonzero and the negative dot product implies an obtuse angle.

$1(-2)+(-2)(1)=-2-2=-4$

$-4$ Dimensionless

$\|a\|=\|b\|=\sqrt5,\quad\cos\theta=-4/5<0$

Do not drop negative signs.$mw$),
(934,1695,$mw$92DF19B1D8D940C9EA1EB4ED145D5B87E3AB3B8B13287CC5A879A1ED1C2FCCC0$mw$,$mw$0b86b22ef13b95c5957c3d0f4cad5d65$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1695,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":87,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما مقدار الإسقاط القياسي الموقع للمتجه (3,4) على اتجاه المتجه (1,0)؟","TitleEn":"What is the signed scalar projection of (3,4) onto the direction of (1,0)?","QuestionTextAr":"ما مقدار الإسقاط القياسي الموقع للمتجه (3,4) على اتجاه المتجه (1,0)؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the signed scalar projection of (3,4) onto the direction of (1,0)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: قانون الإسقاط القياسي الموقع: comp_b(a) = (a·b)/|b|.\n\nخطوات الحل: الإسقاط القياسي يساوي حاصل الضرب القياسي مقسوماً على طول (1,0): ‏3÷1=3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Signed scalar projection: comp_b(a) = (a·b)/|b|.\n\nSolution steps: The signed scalar projection equals the dot product divided by the target vector's length: 3/1=3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6769,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6770,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6771,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6772,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"تحقق أن متجه الاتجاه طوله واحد.","En":"Check that the direction vector has length one."},{"Ar":"احسب الضرب القياسي واقسم على طول متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Calculate the dot product and divide by the direction vector's norm."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما مقدار الإسقاط القياسي الموقع للمتجه (3,4) على اتجاه المتجه (1,0)؟","En":"What is the signed scalar projection of (3,4) onto the direction of (1,0)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"1 معيار متجه الاتجاه وليس إسقاط المتجه الأصلي.","En":"1 is the direction norm, not the projection."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 المركبة العمودية على اتجاه الإسقاط.","En":"4 is the component perpendicular to the projection direction."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"5 معيار المتجه الأصلي وليس إسقاطه.","En":"5 is the original vector norm, not its projection."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما مقدار الإسقاط القياسي الموقع للمتجه (3,4) على اتجاه المتجه (1,0)؟","En":"What is the signed scalar projection of (3,4) onto the direction of (1,0)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الإسقاط القياسي الموقّع هو الضرب القياسي على متجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"Signed scalar projection is the dot product with the direction's unit vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة طول","En":"Length units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"متجه الاتجاه غير صفري ومعياره واحد.","En":"The direction vector is nonzero and has norm one."},{"Ar":"$u\\cdot v=3(1)+4(0)=3$","En":"$u\\cdot v=3(1)+4(0)=3$"},{"Ar":"نقسم الضرب القياسي على معيار الاتجاه، والناتج موجب.","En":"Divide the dot product by the direction norm; the result is positive."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل طول المتجه الأصلي مكان الإسقاط.","En":"Do not substitute the original vector's length for its projection."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{comp}_{\\mathbf v}\\mathbf u=\\frac{\\mathbf u\\cdot\\mathbf v}{\\|\\mathbf v\\|}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(3,4)\\cdot(1,0)/1=3$","En":"$(3,4)\\cdot(1,0)/1=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(3,0)+(0,4)=(3,4)$","En":"$(3,0)+(0,4)=(3,4)$"}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":338,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"تحقق أن متجه الاتجاه طوله واحد.","En":"Check that the direction vector has length one."},{"Ar":"احسب الضرب القياسي واقسم على طول متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Calculate the dot product and divide by the direction vector's norm."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الإسقاط القياسي الموقّع هو الضرب القياسي على متجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"Signed scalar projection is the dot product with the direction's unit vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة طول","En":"Length units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"متجه الاتجاه غير صفري ومعياره واحد.","En":"The direction vector is nonzero and has norm one."},{"Ar":"$u\\cdot v=3(1)+4(0)=3$","En":"$u\\cdot v=3(1)+4(0)=3$"},{"Ar":"نقسم الضرب القياسي على معيار الاتجاه، والناتج موجب.","En":"Divide the dot product by the direction norm; the result is positive."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل طول المتجه الأصلي مكان الإسقاط.","En":"Do not substitute the original vector's length for its projection."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{comp}_{\\mathbf v}\\mathbf u=\\frac{\\mathbf u\\cdot\\mathbf v}{\\|\\mathbf v\\|}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(3,4)\\cdot(1,0)/1=3$","En":"$(3,4)\\cdot(1,0)/1=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(3,0)+(0,4)=(3,4)$","En":"$(3,0)+(0,4)=(3,4)$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 معيار متجه الاتجاه وليس إسقاط المتجه الأصلي.","En":"1 is the direction norm, not the projection."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 المركبة العمودية على اتجاه الإسقاط.","En":"4 is the component perpendicular to the projection direction."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 معيار المتجه الأصلي وليس إسقاطه.","En":"5 is the original vector norm, not its projection."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الإسقاط القياسي الموقّع هو الضرب القياسي على متجه وحدة الاتجاه.

$\operatorname{comp}_{\mathbf v}\mathbf u=\frac{\mathbf u\cdot\mathbf v}{\|\mathbf v\|}$

1. متجه الاتجاه غير صفري ومعياره واحد.

2. $u\cdot v=3(1)+4(0)=3$

3. نقسم الضرب القياسي على معيار الاتجاه، والناتج موجب.

$(3,4)\cdot(1,0)/1=3$

$3$ وحدة طول

$(3,0)+(0,4)=(3,4)$

لا تستعمل طول المتجه الأصلي مكان الإسقاط.$mw$,$mw$Signed scalar projection is the dot product with the direction's unit vector.

$\operatorname{comp}_{\mathbf v}\mathbf u=\frac{\mathbf u\cdot\mathbf v}{\|\mathbf v\|}$

1. The direction vector is nonzero and has norm one.

2. $u\cdot v=3(1)+4(0)=3$

3. Divide the dot product by the direction norm; the result is positive.

$(3,4)\cdot(1,0)/1=3$

$3$ Length units

$(3,0)+(0,4)=(3,4)$

Do not substitute the original vector's length for its projection.$mw$),
(936,1699,$mw$20D2993807CC59B1A4508DB9AF7B57DBC53977AB685C558C2CEE3C8B780DCBF2$mw$,$mw$90e603274a6d327aa7d88f3cacff84e8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1699,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":91,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما القيمة الصغرى للدالة f(x)=x²−4x+1 على مجموعة الأعداد الحقيقية؟","TitleEn":"What is the global minimum value of f(x)=x²−4x+1 over the real numbers?","QuestionTextAr":"ما القيمة الصغرى للدالة f(x)=x²−4x+1 على مجموعة الأعداد الحقيقية؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the global minimum value of f(x)=x²−4x+1 over the real numbers?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: قاعدة إكمال المربع: (x−a)²≥0، فتكون أدنى قيمة عند انعدام الحد المربّع.\n\nخطوات الحل: نكمل المربع: f(x)=(x−2)²−3، وأصغر قيمة للمربع صفر، لذا القيمة الصغرى −3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Completing-square principle: (x−a)²≥0, with the minimum when the square vanishes.\n\nSolution steps: Complete the square: f(x)=(x−2)²−3; the square is minimized at zero, giving −3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6785,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6786,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6787,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6788,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"معامل x² موجب، لذا للدالة التربيعية قيمة صغرى عالمية.","En":"The x² coefficient is positive, so the quadratic has a global minimum."},{"Ar":"أكمل المربع أو أوجد رأس القطع المكافئ ثم احسب قيمة الدالة.","En":"Complete the square or find the vertex, then evaluate the function."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما القيمة الصغرى للدالة f(x)=x²−4x+1 على مجموعة الأعداد الحقيقية؟","En":"What is the global minimum value of f(x)=x²−4x+1 over the real numbers?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"−4 لا يمكن بلوغها لأن المربع غير سالب.","En":"−4 is unattainable because the square is nonnegative."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"0 أكبر من القيمة عند رأس المنحنى.","En":"0 exceeds the value at the vertex."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"1 قيمة الدالة عند الصفر وليست حدها الأدنى.","En":"1 is the value at zero, not the minimum."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما القيمة الصغرى للدالة f(x)=x²−4x+1 على مجموعة الأعداد الحقيقية؟","En":"What is the global minimum value of f(x)=x²−4x+1 over the real numbers?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"إكمال المربع يكشف الحد الأدنى العالمي.","En":"Completing the square reveals the global minimum."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف 4 ونطرحها لإكمال المربع دون تغيير الدالة.","En":"Add and subtract four to complete the square without changing the function."},{"Ar":"$f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$","En":"$f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$"},{"Ar":"المربع غير سالب لكل عدد حقيقي وينعدم عند القيمة 2؛ لذا الحد الأدنى متحقق.","En":"The square is nonnegative for every real input and vanishes at 2, so the lower bound is attained."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3$","En":"$-3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط قيمة الحد الأدنى بموضعه x=2.","En":"Do not confuse the minimum value with its argument x=2."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2-4x+1=(x-2)^2-3","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(x-2)^2\\ge0$","En":"$(x-2)^2\\ge0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f(2)=4-8+1=-3$","En":"$f(2)=4-8+1=-3$"}},"TrackIds":[19,21],"CategoryId":91,"PrimarySkillId":343,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"معامل x² موجب، لذا للدالة التربيعية قيمة صغرى عالمية.","En":"The x² coefficient is positive, so the quadratic has a global minimum."},{"Ar":"أكمل المربع أو أوجد رأس القطع المكافئ ثم احسب قيمة الدالة.","En":"Complete the square or find the vertex, then evaluate the function."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"إكمال المربع يكشف الحد الأدنى العالمي.","En":"Completing the square reveals the global minimum."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضيف 4 ونطرحها لإكمال المربع دون تغيير الدالة.","En":"Add and subtract four to complete the square without changing the function."},{"Ar":"$f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$","En":"$f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$"},{"Ar":"المربع غير سالب لكل عدد حقيقي وينعدم عند القيمة 2؛ لذا الحد الأدنى متحقق.","En":"The square is nonnegative for every real input and vanishes at 2, so the lower bound is attained."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3$","En":"$-3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط قيمة الحد الأدنى بموضعه x=2.","En":"Do not confuse the minimum value with its argument x=2."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2-4x+1=(x-2)^2-3","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(x-2)^2\\ge0$","En":"$(x-2)^2\\ge0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f(2)=4-8+1=-3$","En":"$f(2)=4-8+1=-3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−4 لا يمكن بلوغها لأن المربع غير سالب.","En":"−4 is unattainable because the square is nonnegative."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"0 أكبر من القيمة عند رأس المنحنى.","En":"0 exceeds the value at the vertex."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 قيمة الدالة عند الصفر وليست حدها الأدنى.","En":"1 is the value at zero, not the minimum."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$إكمال المربع يكشف الحد الأدنى العالمي.

$x^2-4x+1=(x-2)^2-3$

1. نضيف 4 ونطرحها لإكمال المربع دون تغيير الدالة.

2. $f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$

3. المربع غير سالب لكل عدد حقيقي وينعدم عند القيمة 2؛ لذا الحد الأدنى متحقق.

$(x-2)^2\ge0$

$-3$ بلا وحدة محددة

$f(2)=4-8+1=-3$

لا تخلط قيمة الحد الأدنى بموضعه x=2.$mw$,$mw$Completing the square reveals the global minimum.

$x^2-4x+1=(x-2)^2-3$

1. Add and subtract four to complete the square without changing the function.

2. $f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$

3. The square is nonnegative for every real input and vanishes at 2, so the lower bound is attained.

$(x-2)^2\ge0$

$-3$ No specified unit

$f(2)=4-8+1=-3$

Do not confuse the minimum value with its argument x=2.$mw$),
(938,1701,$mw$E6D6B741A01FDE3EEA50E6125EAE42FAFCD494FFDACEA0C004F8888B05AA0AE4$mw$,$mw$310b2558fc167496afae3619e2905a99$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1701,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":91,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"للدالة f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 على المجال المغلق [0,4]، ما أكبر قيمة لها؟","TitleEn":"For f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 on the closed interval [0,4], what is its maximum value?","QuestionTextAr":"للدالة f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 على المجال المغلق [0,4]، ما أكبر قيمة لها؟","QuestionTextEn":"For f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 on the closed interval [0,4], what is its maximum value?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: لتعظيم دالة على مجال مغلق، نفحص النقاط الحرجة والأطراف.\n\nخطوات الحل: القيمة الكبرى عند قمة القطع المكافئ x=1 وهي داخل المجال، فنحصل على f(1)=9.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: To maximize on a closed interval, check stationary points and endpoints.\n\nSolution steps: The downward-opening parabola reaches its vertex at x=1 inside the interval, where f(1)=9.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6793,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6794,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6795,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6796,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"الدالة على صورة ثابت ناقص مربع.","En":"The function is a constant minus a square."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن موضع انعدام المربع وتأكد أنه ضمن المجال المغلق قبل حساب القيمة.","En":"Find where the square vanishes and verify it belongs to the closed interval."}],"Title":{"Ar":"للدالة f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 على المجال المغلق [0,4]، ما أكبر قيمة لها؟","En":"For f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 on the closed interval [0,4], what is its maximum value?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"5 أصغر من القيمة المتحققة عند الرأس.","En":"5 is below the attained vertex value."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"8 قيمة الطرف الأيسر فقط.","En":"8 is only the left endpoint value."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"10 يتجاوز الحد الأعلى 9.","En":"10 exceeds the upper bound of 9."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"للدالة f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 على المجال المغلق [0,4]، ما أكبر قيمة لها؟","En":"For f(x)=−(x−1)²+9 on the closed interval [0,4], what is its maximum value?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المربع المطروح غير سالب، والرأس يقع داخل المجال.","En":"The subtracted square is nonnegative and the vertex lies in the interval."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المربع غير سالب، وبالتالي لا يمكن أن تتجاوز الدالة 9.","En":"The square is nonnegative, so the function cannot exceed 9."},{"Ar":"ينعدم المربع عند القيمة 1 وهي ضمن المجال المعطى.","En":"The square vanishes at 1, which is in the given interval."},{"Ar":"نعوض عند الرأس ونقارن بقيم الطرفين للتحقق.","En":"Evaluate at the vertex and compare with the endpoint values."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$9$","En":"$9$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بفحص الطرفين؛ نقطة الرأس داخل المجال.","En":"Do not check only endpoints; the vertex is inside the interval."},"FormulaLatex":"9-(x-1)^2\\le9","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f(1)=9$","En":"$f(1)=9$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f(0)=8,\\ f(4)=0,\\ f(1)=9$","En":"$f(0)=8,\\ f(4)=0,\\ f(1)=9$"}},"TrackIds":[19,21],"CategoryId":91,"PrimarySkillId":343,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"الدالة على صورة ثابت ناقص مربع.","En":"The function is a constant minus a square."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن موضع انعدام المربع وتأكد أنه ضمن المجال المغلق قبل حساب القيمة.","En":"Find where the square vanishes and verify it belongs to the closed interval."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المربع المطروح غير سالب، والرأس يقع داخل المجال.","En":"The subtracted square is nonnegative and the vertex lies in the interval."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المربع غير سالب، وبالتالي لا يمكن أن تتجاوز الدالة 9.","En":"The square is nonnegative, so the function cannot exceed 9."},{"Ar":"ينعدم المربع عند القيمة 1 وهي ضمن المجال المعطى.","En":"The square vanishes at 1, which is in the given interval."},{"Ar":"نعوض عند الرأس ونقارن بقيم الطرفين للتحقق.","En":"Evaluate at the vertex and compare with the endpoint values."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$9$","En":"$9$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بفحص الطرفين؛ نقطة الرأس داخل المجال.","En":"Do not check only endpoints; the vertex is inside the interval."},"FormulaLatex":"9-(x-1)^2\\le9","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f(1)=9$","En":"$f(1)=9$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f(0)=8,\\ f(4)=0,\\ f(1)=9$","En":"$f(0)=8,\\ f(4)=0,\\ f(1)=9$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 أصغر من القيمة المتحققة عند الرأس.","En":"5 is below the attained vertex value."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8 قيمة الطرف الأيسر فقط.","En":"8 is only the left endpoint value."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 يتجاوز الحد الأعلى 9.","En":"10 exceeds the upper bound of 9."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المربع المطروح غير سالب، والرأس يقع داخل المجال.

$9-(x-1)^2\le9$

1. المربع غير سالب، وبالتالي لا يمكن أن تتجاوز الدالة 9.

2. ينعدم المربع عند القيمة 1 وهي ضمن المجال المعطى.

3. نعوض عند الرأس ونقارن بقيم الطرفين للتحقق.

$f(1)=9$

$9$ بلا وحدة محددة

$f(0)=8,\ f(4)=0,\ f(1)=9$

لا تكتف بفحص الطرفين؛ نقطة الرأس داخل المجال.$mw$,$mw$The subtracted square is nonnegative and the vertex lies in the interval.

$9-(x-1)^2\le9$

1. The square is nonnegative, so the function cannot exceed 9.

2. The square vanishes at 1, which is in the given interval.

3. Evaluate at the vertex and compare with the endpoint values.

$f(1)=9$

$9$ No specified unit

$f(0)=8,\ f(4)=0,\ f(1)=9$

Do not check only endpoints; the vertex is inside the interval.$mw$),
(943,1707,$mw$25DF7F4D4CF4AA39BF1346761F673B4055053A74B0FB493F4D5B3C4D28B5511F$mw$,$mw$fe94a3cb6d4cb8671b2f0a1a0fb37ef9$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1707,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":81,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"كم عدد الأعداد الصحيحة من 200 إلى 299 التي يكون رقم العشرات فيها 4؟","TitleEn":"How many integers from 200 through 299 have 4 in the tens place?","QuestionTextAr":"كم عدد الأعداد الصحيحة من 200 إلى 299 التي يكون رقم العشرات فيها 4؟","QuestionTextEn":"How many integers from 200 through 299 have 4 in the tens place?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: في المنازل العشرية كل رقم آحاد من 0 إلى 9 يكوّن عدداً مختلفاً مع تثبيت المئات والعشرات.\n\nخطوات الحل: الأعداد هي 240، 241، ...، 249. هذه عشرة أعداد، لأن الآحاد لها عشر قيم ممكنة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Fixing the hundreds and tens digits leaves ten possible units digits, from 0 through 9.\n\nSolution steps: The integers are 240, 241, ..., 249. There are ten choices for the units digit.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6817,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6818,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6819,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6820,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"100","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ثبت المئات والعشرات أولاً.","En":"Fix hundreds and tens first."},{"Ar":"ابدأ بأول عدد يحقق الشرط، وعد الأعداد المتتالية حتى تتغير منزلة العشرات.","En":"Start at the first matching number and count consecutive values until the tens digit changes."}],"Title":{"Ar":"كم عدد الأعداد الصحيحة من 200 إلى 299 التي يكون رقم العشرات فيها 4؟","En":"How many integers from 200 through 299 have 4 in the tens place?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"9 ينتج من طرح الطرفين دون إضافة واحد.","En":"9 subtracts the endpoints without adding one."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"11 يزيد عدداً خارج المجال المطلوب.","En":"11 includes an extra number outside the matching range."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"100 عدد جميع الأعداد من 200 إلى 299 دون شرط العشرات.","En":"100 counts all integers from 200 to 299 without the tens condition."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"100"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"كم عدد الأعداد الصحيحة من 200 إلى 299 التي يكون رقم العشرات فيها 4؟","En":"How many integers from 200 through 299 have 4 in the tens place?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تثبيت المئات والعشرات يترك عشرة اختيارات للآحاد.","En":"Fixing hundreds and tens leaves ten possible ones digits."},"Unit":{"Ar":"","En":""},"Steps":[{"Ar":"رقم المئات ثابت وهو 2، ورقم العشرات المطلوب 4.","En":"The hundreds digit is fixed at 2 and the tens digit must be 4."},{"Ar":"يمكن أن يكون رقم الآحاد أي رقم من 0 إلى 9.","En":"The ones digit can be any digit from 0 to 9."},{"Ar":"أول عدد هو 240 وآخر عدد هو 249؛ نعدهما معاً.","En":"The first number is 240 and the last is 249; count both endpoints."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس العدد الذي آحاده صفر عند العد.","En":"Do not omit the number ending in zero."},"FormulaLatex":"N=240+d,\\quad 0\\le d\\le9","Substitution":{"Ar":"$249-240+1=10$","En":"$249-240+1=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$240\\le N\\le249$","En":"$240\\le N\\le249$"}},"TrackIds":[2],"CategoryId":81,"PrimarySkillId":302,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ثبت المئات والعشرات أولاً.","En":"Fix hundreds and tens first."},{"Ar":"ابدأ بأول عدد يحقق الشرط، وعد الأعداد المتتالية حتى تتغير منزلة العشرات.","En":"Start at the first matching number and count consecutive values until the tens digit changes."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تثبيت المئات والعشرات يترك عشرة اختيارات للآحاد.","En":"Fixing hundreds and tens leaves ten possible ones digits."},"Unit":{"Ar":"","En":""},"Steps":[{"Ar":"رقم المئات ثابت وهو 2، ورقم العشرات المطلوب 4.","En":"The hundreds digit is fixed at 2 and the tens digit must be 4."},{"Ar":"يمكن أن يكون رقم الآحاد أي رقم من 0 إلى 9.","En":"The ones digit can be any digit from 0 to 9."},{"Ar":"أول عدد هو 240 وآخر عدد هو 249؛ نعدهما معاً.","En":"The first number is 240 and the last is 249; count both endpoints."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس العدد الذي آحاده صفر عند العد.","En":"Do not omit the number ending in zero."},"FormulaLatex":"N=240+d,\\quad 0\\le d\\le9","Substitution":{"Ar":"$249-240+1=10$","En":"$249-240+1=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$240\\le N\\le249$","En":"$240\\le N\\le249$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"9 ينتج من طرح الطرفين دون إضافة واحد.","En":"9 subtracts the endpoints without adding one."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11 يزيد عدداً خارج المجال المطلوب.","En":"11 includes an extra number outside the matching range."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"100 عدد جميع الأعداد من 200 إلى 299 دون شرط العشرات.","En":"100 counts all integers from 200 to 299 without the tens condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تثبيت المئات والعشرات يترك عشرة اختيارات للآحاد.

$N=240+d,\quad 0\le d\le9$

1. رقم المئات ثابت وهو 2، ورقم العشرات المطلوب 4.

2. يمكن أن يكون رقم الآحاد أي رقم من 0 إلى 9.

3. أول عدد هو 240 وآخر عدد هو 249؛ نعدهما معاً.

$249-240+1=10$

$10$

$240\le N\le249$

لا تنس العدد الذي آحاده صفر عند العد.$mw$,$mw$Fixing hundreds and tens leaves ten possible ones digits.

$N=240+d,\quad 0\le d\le9$

1. The hundreds digit is fixed at 2 and the tens digit must be 4.

2. The ones digit can be any digit from 0 to 9.

3. The first number is 240 and the last is 249; count both endpoints.

$249-240+1=10$

$10$

$240\le N\le249$

Do not omit the number ending in zero.$mw$),
(944,1708,$mw$4362E4B06897F5A86F22142E8F8AC2E0407DF97943DE21483BFD5FBDE9E52330$mw$,$mw$6c34c5561330b889f9075d96a8f2acb1$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1708,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":81,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"بدأ عدّاد عند 6,005 ثم نقص 90. ما العدد الجديد؟","TitleEn":"A counter starts at 6,005 and decreases by 90. What is the new value?","QuestionTextAr":"بدأ عدّاد عند 6,005 ثم نقص 90. ما العدد الجديد؟","QuestionTextEn":"A counter starts at 6,005 and decreases by 90. What is the new value?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: نطرح وفق القيمة المكانية ونستلف من منزلة أعلى عندما لا تكفي العشرات.\n\nخطوات الحل: نكتب 6,005 − 90 = 5,915. التحقق: 5,915 + 90 = 6,005.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Subtract by place value and regroup from a higher place when the tens place is insufficient.\n\nSolution steps: Compute 6,005 − 90 = 5,915. Check by adding 90 back: 5,915 + 90 = 6,005.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6821,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5915","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6822,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"5015","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6823,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"5995","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6824,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6105","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"فكّر في 90 كفرق بين 100 و10.","En":"Think of 90 as the difference between 100 and 10."},{"Ar":"اطرح المئة ثم صحح بمقدار الفرق.","En":"Subtract one hundred, then compensate by the difference."}],"Title":{"Ar":"بدأ عدّاد عند 6,005 ثم نقص 90. ما العدد الجديد؟","En":"A counter starts at 6,005 and decreases by 90. What is the new value?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"5915"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"5015 أقل من البداية بمقدار 990 وليس 90.","En":"5015 is 990 below the starting value, not 90."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5015"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"5995 أقل من البداية بمقدار 10 فقط.","En":"5995 is only 10 below the starting value."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5995"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"6105 أكبر من البداية ولا يمثل نقصاناً.","En":"6105 is above the starting value, not a decrease."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6105"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"بدأ عدّاد عند 6,005 ثم نقص 90. ما العدد الجديد؟","En":"A counter starts at 6,005 and decreases by 90. What is the new value?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة بعد نقصان ثابت تساوي البداية ناقص مقدار النقص.","En":"After a fixed decrease, the value is the start minus the decrease."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقص يعني الطرح لا الجمع.","En":"A decrease means subtraction, not addition."},{"Ar":"نكتب 90 على صورة 100 ناقص 10، ثم نطرح 100 من 6005 فنحصل على 5905.","En":"Write 90 as 100 minus 10; subtract 100 from 6005 to get 5905."},{"Ar":"نعيد إضافة 10 لتعويض الزيادة في الطرح، فنحصل على 5915.","En":"Add back 10 to compensate for subtracting too much, giving 5915."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5915$","En":"$5915$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل إعادة التجميع عند المرور بالصفر.","En":"Do not ignore regrouping through zero."},"FormulaLatex":"N=S-d","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6005-100+10=5915$","En":"$6005-100+10=5915$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5915+90=6005$","En":"$5915+90=6005$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":81,"PrimarySkillId":305,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"فكّر في 90 كفرق بين 100 و10.","En":"Think of 90 as the difference between 100 and 10."},{"Ar":"اطرح المئة ثم صحح بمقدار الفرق.","En":"Subtract one hundred, then compensate by the difference."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القيمة بعد نقصان ثابت تساوي البداية ناقص مقدار النقص.","En":"After a fixed decrease, the value is the start minus the decrease."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقص يعني الطرح لا الجمع.","En":"A decrease means subtraction, not addition."},{"Ar":"نكتب 90 على صورة 100 ناقص 10، ثم نطرح 100 من 6005 فنحصل على 5905.","En":"Write 90 as 100 minus 10; subtract 100 from 6005 to get 5905."},{"Ar":"نعيد إضافة 10 لتعويض الزيادة في الطرح، فنحصل على 5915.","En":"Add back 10 to compensate for subtracting too much, giving 5915."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5915$","En":"$5915$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل إعادة التجميع عند المرور بالصفر.","En":"Do not ignore regrouping through zero."},"FormulaLatex":"N=S-d","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6005-100+10=5915$","En":"$6005-100+10=5915$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5915+90=6005$","En":"$5915+90=6005$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5015 أقل من البداية بمقدار 990 وليس 90.","En":"5015 is 990 below the starting value, not 90."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5995 أقل من البداية بمقدار 10 فقط.","En":"5995 is only 10 below the starting value."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6105 أكبر من البداية ولا يمثل نقصاناً.","En":"6105 is above the starting value, not a decrease."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القيمة بعد نقصان ثابت تساوي البداية ناقص مقدار النقص.

$N=S-d$

1. النقص يعني الطرح لا الجمع.

2. نكتب 90 على صورة 100 ناقص 10، ثم نطرح 100 من 6005 فنحصل على 5905.

3. نعيد إضافة 10 لتعويض الزيادة في الطرح، فنحصل على 5915.

$6005-100+10=5915$

$5915$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5915+90=6005$

لا تهمل إعادة التجميع عند المرور بالصفر.$mw$,$mw$After a fixed decrease, the value is the start minus the decrease.

$N=S-d$

1. A decrease means subtraction, not addition.

2. Write 90 as 100 minus 10; subtract 100 from 6005 to get 5905.

3. Add back 10 to compensate for subtracting too much, giving 5915.

$6005-100+10=5915$

$5915$ Dimensionless

$5915+90=6005$

Do not ignore regrouping through zero.$mw$);
